mland-atlas/minnesota/renville-county"],["ARC or PLC in Renville County","/arc-plc/minnesota/renville-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, January to February was 14% of normal and September to October was 53%. So far in 2026 on the middle, April to May was 57% of normal and June to July was 105%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 29839 fell to 46% that year.</p>"}
